WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.291 line:90% align:center
<i>Caspion was a small silver fish who loved
to swim faster and farther than all</i>

2
00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:12.190 line:90% align:center
<i>the others.</i>

3
00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:18.060 line:90% align:center
Come on, everybody! Let's
see what's beyond the reef!

4
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:25.250 line:90% align:center
<i>But his friends were afraid to leave
the reef, so Caspion set out alone.</i>

5
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.850 line:90% align:center
<i>Far from home, Caspion
heard someone crying.</i>

6
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:36.560 line:90% align:center
Why are you crying, little whale?

7
00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:42.550 line:90% align:center
I lost my mother in the
storm... I'm all alone.

8
00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:49.440 line:90% align:center
Don't worry. I'll help you find her!

9
00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:10.010 line:90% align:center
Well, well... a snack and a dessert.

10
00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:15.240 line:90% align:center
Help!

11
00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:18.760 line:90% align:center
Leave those little ones alone!

12
00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:27.760 line:90% align:center
Mama! You found me!

13
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:32.220 line:90% align:center
This is Caspion. He helped me!

14
00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:36.220 line:90% align:center
Thank you, brave little fish.

15
00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:46.490 line:90% align:center
So you want to see the world
above the water, little fish?

16
00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:49.630 line:90% align:center
More than anything!

17
00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:57.600 line:90% align:center
Then my friend the jellyfish will carry
you, with a little sea inside her bell.

18
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:17.730 line:90% align:center
<i>And so Caspion rose up, up, up... until
he saw the sky for the very first time.</i>

19
00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:38.640 line:90% align:center
The world is simply
wonderful... wet or dry!

20
00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:41.640 line:90% align:center
העולם פשוט נפלא, רטוב או יבש!

